      "title": "Final dividend reduced to ₹2.00",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹2.00 is 20% lower than last year. Ex-date: 19th May 2026 Payment date: 11th June 2026 Dividend yield will be 0.8%, which is higher than the industry average of 0.6%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by both earnings (14% earnings payout ratio) and cash flows (10% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 6.2% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. Earnings per share has grown by 6.6% over the last 5 years. Unless this trend reverses, it should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
